|content1=
* August 26th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' enter CS:GO with the signing of a squad consisting of [[INSANITY]], [[willyKS]], [[Xtinct]], [[moojuice]], and [[majestic (Canadian player)|majestic]]. <ref name="ground zero first squad">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/901385481144770560|title=Very happy to announce our brand new CGi lineup!|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2017-08-26}}</ref>
* December 11th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' release [[INSANITY]]. <ref name="insanity released">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/940449050590982144|title=iNSANITY^ has been removed from the active roster of @Gzerogaming CSGO team|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''date=2017-12-11}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 2nd - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[apocdud]]. <ref name="apocdud signed">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/948104009939742720|title=Welcome aboard @apocdud to the active Ground Zero Gaming <nowiki>[#CSGO]</nowiki> roster!|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2018-01-02}}</ref>
* February 25th - [[HaZr]] replaces [[moojuice]] on '''Ground Zero Gaming'''.  <ref name="moojuice replaced">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/967695818072375296|title=Introducing the newest member to the Ground Zero CS:GO squad - @Hazr_CS! |author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2018-02-25}}</ref>
* March 13th - [[HaZR]] leaves '''Ground Zero Gaming''', [[majestic (Canadian player)|majestic]] is moved to the bench. [[Kaotik]] and [[waffe]] join the team. <ref name="2 join">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/973486074298118145|title=Please welcome @officialkaotik and @WaffeAu to the CS:GO starting lineup! |author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2018-03-13}}</ref>
* May 17th - [[PeetyG]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming''' as the team's coach. <ref name="peetyg coach">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/997050687472074752|title=We are excited to announce the newest addition to the Ground Zero family - @IamPeetyG!|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2018-05-17}}</ref>
* May 23rd - [[InJect]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming''', [[apocdud]] leaves the team. <ref name="apocdud leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/999544306967896064|title=We would like to give a huge thank you to @apocdud for his time within Ground Zero|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''|date=2018-05-23}}</ref>
* July 4th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' release [[willyKS]]. <ref name="willy released">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1014414265619505152|title=@willyKS11 has been released from GZ, effective immediately|date=2018-07-04|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 5th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' release [[Kaotik]]. <ref name="kaotik released">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1014802783411765252|title=@officialkaotik has been released from GZ, effective immediately|date=2018-07-05|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 7th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[kyoto]] and [[NikkeZ]]. <ref name="gzg sign kyoto and nikkez">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/24179/ground-zero-sign-kyoto-and-nikkez|title=Ground Zero add kyoto and NikkeZ|date=2018-07-07 |author=[[flam3z]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* July 29th - [[waffe]] leaves '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="waffe leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/WaffeAu/status/1023823095092539392|date=2018-07-29|title=LFT. Parted from GZ|author=[[waffe]]}}</ref>
* August 1st - [[InfrequeNt]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="infrequent joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1024574231869370368|date=2018-08-01|title=Please welcome @InfrequeNtcs to Ground Zero!|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 25th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' replace [[InfrequeNt]] and [[InJect]] with [[deStiny]] and [[BURNRUOk]]. <ref name="ground zero more roster changes">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/24884/ground-zero-add-burnruok-and-destiny-infrequent-and-inject-leave|title=Ground Zero add BURNRUOk and deStiny; InfrequeNt and InJect leave|date=2018-09-25|author=[[flam3z]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* October 10th - [[kyoto]] steps down from the staring lineup. [[void]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming''' in his place. <ref name="kyoto out">{{cite web|url=http://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sqmc7o|title=CSGO Roster Update - Kyoto moves to sub, will be replaced by Void|date=2018-10-10|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 16th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' replace [[deStiny]] with [[zemp]]. <ref name="ground zero zemp">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1085447080649211904|date=2019-01-16|title=We are excited to announce our latest edition to our Counter-Strike lineup, @zempgo|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* February 4th - [[PeetyG]] leaves '''Ground Zero Gaming''' to join [[SYF Gaming]]. <ref name="peety syf">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/notes/syf-gaming/syf-gaming-csgo/2269477799737576/|date=2019-02-04|title=Today, SYF have decided to step back into the CS:GO scene and adopt a brand new approach to do it|author=[[SYF Gaming]]}}</ref>
* February 26th - [[MoeycQ]] replaces [[NikkeZ]] on '''Ground Zero Gaming'''.  <ref name="nikkez leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1100305001082056704|date=2019-02-26|title=It is with a heavy heart we say farewell to @NikkeZcsgo from our starting five CS:GO roster|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="moe joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1100662064383549440|title=We are incredibly excited to announce our latest addition to the Ground Zero counter-strike roster, @MoeycQ|date=2019-02-26|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 29th - [[burk]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming''' as the team's coach. <ref name="burk joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1133929063263825920|title=Please welcome @burkCS as our new CS:GO team coach!|date=2019-05-29|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* June 4th - [[pan1K]] replaces [[Xtinct]] on '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="xtinct out">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1135803403806765056|title=You may have seen him fragging with the team before, but we would like to formally announce the addition of @pan1KOCE to our CS:GO roster!|date=2019-06-04|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 29th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[MoeycQ]]. <ref name="MoeycQ leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1155787910341251073|title=Farewell @MoeycQ, it's been a blast!|date=2019-07-29|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 5th - [[zeph]] joins '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="gz zeph">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1158270975613403136|title=Introducing @zephcs to our Ground Zero CS:GO Roster!|date=2019-08-05|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* October 14th - [[zemp]] and [[pan1k]] leave '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="zemp pan1k leave">{{cite web|url=https://www.htt.news/news/pan1k-and-zemp-depart-ground-zero|title=Pan1k and Zemp depart Ground Zero CS:GO|date=2019-10-14|publisher=[[HTT News]]|author=[[Ben Scott]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 14th - [[zeph]] retires from CS:GO and leaves the team. <ref name="zeph retired">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/zephcs/status/1217061722109775872|date=2020-01-14|title=I've decided to take an indefinite break from CS|author=[[zeph]]}}</ref>
* February 4th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[Llamas]], [[Noobster]], and [[PEARSS]]. [[Kingfisher]] leaves the team. <ref name="gz 2020">{{cite web|url=https://groundzerogaming.com.au/blogs/news/cs-go-roster-update-2020-line-up|date=2020-02-04|title=CS:GO Roster Update: 2020 Line Up|publisher='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* February 24th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' bring back [[Kingfisher]] as the team's coach. <ref name="kingfisher 2.0">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1231850006371434496|date=2020-02-24|title=Please Welcome @KingfisherOCE to the Ground Zero CS:GO Roster as our team coach!|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 3rd - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[Kingfisher]]. <ref name="kingfisher 2.0 out">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1256781692712316928|date=2020-05-03|title=Farewell @KingfisherOCE, It's been a wild ride|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 8th - [[void]] leaves '''Ground Zero Gaming'''. <ref name="void leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/void_cs/status/1258612779285712897|date=2020-05-08|title=Stepping back from Ground Zero|author=[[void]]}}</ref>
* May 14th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[Liki]]. <ref name="Liki joins">{{cite web|url=https://groundzerogaming.com.au/blogs/cs-go/cs-go-roster-update-liki|title=CS:GO Roster Update: Liki|date=2020-05-14|publisher='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 26th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[HudzM]] as coach. <ref name="HudzM coach">{{cite web|url=https://groundzerogaming.com.au/blogs/cs-go/cs-go-roster-update-hudzm|title=CS:GO Roster Update: HudzM|date=2020-05-26|publisher='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' replace [[PEARSS]] and [[Liki]] with [[Mayker]] and [[Laes]]. <ref name="Mayker Laes join">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1293085423812501504|title=Introducing these two weapons: @MaykerCSGO & @laescs to the Ground Zero Gaming CS:GO competitive roster|date=2020-08-11|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 20th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[HudzM]]. <ref name="hudzm out">{{cite web|url=https://groundzerogaming.com.au/blogs/cs-go/cs-go-roster-update-hudzm-1|title=CS:GO Roster Update: HudzM|date=2020-09-20|publisher='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* July 27th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' return to ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' by signing [[ex-Bizarre Gaming]], a lineup consisting of: [[guag]], [[rekonz]], [[2D]], and [[mizzy]]. Additionally, [[nexar]] joins from [[Dynasty Esports Club]] while [[Fiend]] joins as coach. <ref name="gz 2021">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/groundzerooce/status/1419918685058203657|title=We are super proud to announce our re-entry into the Counter-Strike: Global Offensive scene!|date=2021-07-27|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content6=
* July 31st - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' by signing a lineup consisting of [[damyo]], [[apocdud]], [[pz]], [[Drox]], and [[vision]]. <ref name="+housebets">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1950829192809161044|title=We wanted to go sneaky-beaky like... but someone had other plans|date=2025-07-31|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 16th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[Drox]] and acquire [[Omichella]] from [[Underground Esports Club]] as his replacement. <ref name="-Drox">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1956581738261393770|title=With this change, we also bid farewell to @droxCS|date=2025-08-16|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="+Omichella">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/1956581688877650298|title=Roster Update|date=2025-08-16|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content7=
* March 29th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[damyo]]. <ref name="-damyo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/2038119473006227771|title=Every chapter comes to an end|date=2026-03-29|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* March 30th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[sliimey]]. <ref name="+sliimey">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/2038527627552526839|title=We are excited to officially welcome @sliimey1 to the GZ family!|date=2026-03-30|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* March 31st - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[soju_j]] and add [[tucks]] as the team's new coach. <ref name="gz tucks">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/groundzerooce/status/2038844133268234720|title=Roster getting stronger|date=2026-03-31|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 6th - [[sliimey]] is acquired by [[SemperFi Esports]]. <ref name="-sliimey">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/2051955753594814813|title=Roster update|date=2026-05-06|author=[[SemperFi Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 9th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' part ways with [[pz]]. <ref name="-pz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/2064274298286522624|title=After an amazing journey together, today we part ways with @pz_csgo|date=2026-06-09|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
* June 10th - '''Ground Zero Gaming''' sign [[HaZR]] and [[sliimey]]. <ref name="+HaZR +sliimey">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/GroundZeroOCE/status/2064604107902476704|title=Today, we welcome @hazr_cs and @sliimey1 back to Ground Zero|date=2026-06-10|author='''Ground Zero Gaming'''}}</ref>
}}

