|This=1

|content1=
* April 20th – '''INOX Division''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a lineup consisting of [[k1slll]], [[gooddeph]], [[k0s]], [[finW]], [[FenomeN]] and [[Iqlity]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="elitenergy">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/inoxdivision/8|date=2026-04-20|title=OFFICIAL CS2 ROSTER ANNOUNCEMENT|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|author='''INOX Division'''}}</ref>
